Icons sourced from https://game-icons.net (https://github.com/game-icons/icons).

Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported (CC BY 3.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

Per-icon author attribution is listed in VERSION in this directory; the
project-facing credit line lives in the root README.md, as CC BY requires.

Every SVG here has been modified from the original: the author's black
background square was removed and the white foreground path was recolored
to `fill="currentColor"`, so each icon inherits its section's accent color
instead of being a fixed black/white silhouette.
